      "extract": "By introducing a volume-preserving flow we have been able to numerically investigate Hopf solitons and their stability in the Nicole model. It has been demonstrated that the known axially symmetric Hopf solitons are unstable for Hopf charges greater than two and new lower energy solutions have been computed that include links and knots. The formation of links and knots mirrors the situation in the Skyrme-Faddeev",
